Idempotent process call ->
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-> The idempotent process call element is used to invoke a process in a way that ensures idempotency
-> Idempotency means that multiple invocations of the same process with the same input produce the same
result, regardless of the number of invocations
-> it helps to prevent duplicate processing and ensure that the result remains consistent even if the
process is called multiple times.

